{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: `y`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: reordered the model block so that the parameter priors for `alpha`, `beta`, and `sigma` appear before the likelihood statement that uses them. This preserves the same posterior density while satisfying SafeStan's requirement that each parameter be sampled from its prior before any model-block use. No data changes were required.
","model_safe_stan":"data {
  int<lower=1> N; // observations
  int<lower=1> J; // counties
  array[N] int<lower=1, upper=J> county;
  vector[N] x; // floor
  vector[N] y; // radon
}
parameters {
  vector[J] alpha;
  real beta;
  real<lower=0> sigma;
}
model {
  alpha ~ normal(0, 10);
  beta ~ normal(0, 10);
  sigma ~ normal(0, 10);
  y ~ normal(alpha[county] + beta * x, sigma);
}
generated quantities {
  array[N] real y_rep = normal_rng(alpha[county] + beta * x, sigma);
}
","data_safe_json":"{"J":4,"N":3,"county":[1,1,1],"x":[4.267361574457203,3.025212467011545,2.4225084551609264],"y":[3.0,3.0,3.0]}","protected_variables":["y"]}
